<title>UK: Graham Group profits dive, dividend held.</title>
<headline>Graham Group profits dive, dividend held.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-09-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>six months to June 30</p>
<p>			   (million stg unless stated)</p>
<p> Shr (pence)		1.9		    vs 6.1</p>
<p> Dividend (pence)	 1.9		    vs same</p>
<p> Pretax		     4.02		   vs 10.55</p>
<p> Turnover		   268.96		 vs 223.60</p>
<p>NOTE - Building materials company Graham Group Plc said the decline in new housebuilding which led to a weakening of demand has yet to show any firm signs of recovery. But it said current opinion points to a building recovery later this year.  </p>
<p> Operating profit	 6.56		   vs 12.58</p>
<p> Exceptional		nil		    vs same</p>
<p> Interest payable	 2.54		   vs 1.70</p>
<p> Tax			  1.42		   vs 3.54</p>
<p> Net taxed		  2.61		   vs 7.02</p>
<p> Attributable	     0.04 loss	    vs 4.35 profit</p>
<p> Pay date		   November 20</p>
<p>Div registration date  October 15  Ex-div date		October 7</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7717</p>
</text>
